          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Bona! Ndabikila bantu aba zifumpuzyo, nkabela bayoolifumpula kulinzizyo bamawisi abana babo boonse, amuntu amweenzinyina boonse bayoonyonyooka antoomwe.",
