          "text": "O mwana musimbi wabantu bangu, sama zisani zyamasaka, alabana mukati katwe, lila mbubonya mbuli muntu mbwalila mwanaakwe simuzyalwaalike, omoka cakupengesya, nkaambo sikusaala woongomoka kutulwisya,",
